"点一下按钮，就会把“发给 AI 的话”发出去。打开“出新题”的操作使用出新题模型，出的题自动加入题目列表。左滑删除，点右上角“编辑”调整顺序。" = "Tapping a button sends its “Message to the AI”. Shortcuts with “New Question” on use the New Question model, and the questions are added to the question list. Swipe left to delete; tap “Edit” at the top right to reorder.";
"点下面任意服务商，填写 API Key 并选择模型，再点“设为当前使用”。做题时也可以在右上角随时切换模型。" = "Tap any provider below, enter an API key and choose a model, then tap “Use This Provider”. You can also switch models anytime from the top right while practicing.";
