"现在的%@，连同图片、手写笔迹、学习时间、API Key 和各项设置，会复制到这个文件夹，之后都存在那里。原来位置的那份保留不动，可以随时改回来。" = "The current %@, along with images, handwriting, study time, API keys and settings, will be copied to this folder and stored there from now on. The copy at the original location stays as is, so you can switch back anytime.";
"现在的%@，连同图片和手写笔迹，会复制回 App 内，之后存在那里（删除 App 时会一起删掉）。“%@”里的那份保留不动。" = "The current %@, along with images and handwriting, will be copied back into the app and stored there (and deleted if you delete the app). The copy in “%@” stays as is.";
