"默认存在 App 内，删除 App 时会一起删掉。可以选一个“文件”App 里的文件夹（iCloud 云盘或“我的 iPad”），题目、笔记、图片和手写笔迹都存在那里；更新或重新安装 App 后，重新选同一个文件夹就能读到原来的数据。选空文件夹会把现在的数据复制过去；选已有 Stepwise 数据的文件夹会改用那份数据。原来位置的数据不会删除。API Key、服务商、选的模型和常用模型、学习时间和周报、其他设置也会存在这个文件夹里（settings.json，API Key 没有加密，请不要把文件夹分享给别人）。" = "By default data is stored inside the app and deleted with it. You can choose a folder in the Files app (iCloud Drive or On My iPad) to store questions, notes, images and handwriting; after updating or reinstalling, choose the same folder again to get your data back. Choosing an empty folder copies your current data there; choosing a folder that already has Stepwise data switches to that data. Data at the original location is never deleted. API keys, providers, chosen and favorite models, study time, weekly reports and other settings are also stored in this folder (settings.json — API keys are not encrypted, so don't share the folder with others).";
